      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.** That is twice the usual maximum for adults, which is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision.\n- **A single 1600 mg dose is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.**\n- Doses this high raise the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (1,600\u20132,400 mg/day), for pain or fever\n- **1600 mg total per day**, for example 400 mg 4 times daily\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me the clinical reason and I'll enter it with a note. I'd suggest confirming it with pharmacy first."
      }
     ],
